-- NOT RUN. Run in Supabase Dashboard -> SQL Editor, after 20261110_curriculum.sql (the five curriculum tables); the CRE grades in order, 1 to 3 (prerequisites name the grade below; there is no foreign key on them). Idempotent: safe to run twice.
-- WHY: CRE Grade 3 had KICD outcomes only (curriculum/cre/g3.json) and no question families; on 19 Nov 2026 it was mapped to the Grade 5 Maths standard (a skill for every testable outcome, practical outcomes to the teacher's KICD rubric, two or more prerequisites and four misconceptions per skill, a teaching pack). This loads 26 skills (proposed), 52 prerequisites (proposed) and 104 misconceptions (draft)
-- for 22 of 22 sub-strands, for the teacher reviewer. Outcomes are KICD's own words and are not changed.
-- GENERATED by scripts/build-cre-grade.mjs 3 from curriculum/cre/g3.json. Do not edit by hand.
-- The sub-strands and outcomes are inserted first (do nothing if present) so the foreign keys hold.
-- =====================================================================
BEGIN;
